      <p>

        You are responsible for the images and other files you choose to
        process using the website. You should only process files that you
        have the right to use.

      </p>



      <h2>
        Acceptable use
      </h2>


      <p>

        You agree not to misuse the website, attempt to disrupt its
        operation, or use it for unlawful activities.

      </p>



      <h2>
