        Features, tools and these terms may change as ImageSizeChanger
        develops.

      </p>



      <p class="updated">

        Last updated: August 2026

      </p>



    </div>



    <a
      class="back-link"
      href="/"
    >

      ← Back to ImageSizeChanger

    </a>



  </div>


</main>




<footer class="site-footer">


  <div class="container footer-bottom">


    <span>
      © 2026 ImageSizeChanger
    </span>



    <div class="footer-links">


      <a href="/about">
        About
      </a>


      <a href="/privacy">
        Privacy
      </a>


      <a href="/terms">
        Terms
      </a>


      <a href="/contact">
